# RootForge OS — passwordless sudo for live session user
# Victorious Framework | Origin Source Labs
#
# The live user needs passwordless sudo to run adb root, fastboot flash,
# and installer (calamares) without prompts in a session that has no set
# password by default. This file is removed post-install by Calamares's
# removeuser + packages modules — the installed user gets normal sudo.
rootforge ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
